{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Article","title":"QuickStart","role":"article","modules":[{"name":"YEOFR"}]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"1. Add the SDK","anchor":"1-Add-the-SDK","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YEOFR"}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" Swift package"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"https:\/\/github.com\/yeo-messaging\/YEOFR-SPM"},{"type":"text","text":") to your project, pinned to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"exact version "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"0.7.4"}]},{"type":"text","text":", then "},{"code":"import YEOFR","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". The binary is "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"arm64"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"device-only"}]},{"type":"text","text":" — it does not run on the simulator."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"level":2,"text":"2. Pilot unlock for non-YEO bundle IDs","anchor":"2-Pilot-unlock-for-non-YEO-bundle-IDs","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"YEOFR is gated to YEO-owned apps by default; a non-YEO bundle id aborts on"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"construction. Evaluation customers get a "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"temporary unlock code","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" that"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"bypasses the gate during a fixed pilot window — email"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"christo@yeomessaging.com","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" to request one. Pass it to the initializer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(step 3). YEO-owned apps pass the gate natively."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"3-Drive-everything-with-FaceTrustService","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"3. Drive everything with `FaceTrustService`"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" is the turnkey entry point. It owns the engine, the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"camera, the fused-trust pipeline (face recognition + liveness CNN +","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"TrueDepth), the identity gate, and tracker persistence, and exposes two","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"streams: one for live trust verdicts and one for guided enrolment.","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import YEOFR","","let service = FaceTrustService(pilotUnlockCode: \"YOUR-PILOT-CODE\")","","\/\/ Attach the preview to an AVCaptureVideoPreviewLayer:","\/\/   previewLayer.session = service.previewSession","","try await service.start()    \/\/ warm-up, restore enrolment, arm gate, start camera"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"text":"4. Enrol a face","anchor":"4-Enrol-a-face","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"enroll(name:)"},{"type":"text","text":" runs a short guided capture, persists the gallery, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"re-arms the identity gate. Iterate the returned stream to coach the user:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["for await step in service.enroll(name: \"Alice\") {","    switch step.phase {","    case .capturing: show(step.prompt, progress: step.poseProgress)","    case .completed: dismiss()","    case .failed:    show(step.prompt)","    @unknown default: break","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A single front pose is enough to separate the enrolled user from other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"people. Pass "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"poses: PoseTarget.lightingAwareGallerySequence"},{"type":"text","text":" to also"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"capture off-axis poses + a lighting pass, which improves recall as the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"user turns their head."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"5. Run live recognition","anchor":"5-Run-live-recognition","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"codeListing","code":["for await update in service.updates() {","    switch update.status {","    case .trusted:    badge(\"TRUSTED — \\(update.matchedName ?? \"\")\", .green)","    case .notTrusted: badge(\"NOT TRUSTED\", .red)","    case .badFraming: badge(\"ADJUST FRAMING\", .orange)","    case .noFace:     badge(\"NO FACE\", .gray)","    @unknown default: break","    }","    \/\/ update.livenessGenuine \/ update.depthIsThreeD are the contributing signals.","}"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"update.status == .trusted"},{"type":"text","text":" already fuses face recognition, liveness, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"TrueDepth, with framing applied — you never pick a similarity threshold,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and you never touch the identity gate (forgetting it would collapse trust"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to liveness + depth, so any live face would pass). The enrolled gallery is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"saved across launches automatically; ","type":"text"},{"code":"service.enrolledName","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" reflects who is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enrolled.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"See-also","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"See also"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A complete, runnable SwiftUI app lives in the package’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Examples\/FRPilot"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" — full API."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustUpdate","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" \/ "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/EnrollmentProgress","isActive":true},{"text":" — the stream payloads.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"kind":"content"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/QuickStart","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Recognise the enrolled user and reject everyone else, in a few lines."}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Getting started","identifiers":["doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Getting-started"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/quickstart"]},{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/yeofr\/quickstart"]}],"references":{"doc://com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR/documentation/YEOFR/FaceTrustService/updates()":{"abstract":[{"text":"Per-frame trust verdicts for the recognition UI. Call once and iterate;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the stream finishes on ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"stop()"},{"text":". Newest-wins (the underlying camera","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"stream drops stale frames), so a slow consumer can’t back up memory.","type":"text"}],"title":"updates()","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/yeofr\/facetrustservice\/updates()","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.youreyeonly.yeofr.YEOFR\/documentation\/YEOFR\/FaceTrustService\/updates()","role":"symbol